title: viewer:play-pause
tags: [[GUI command]] [[viewer panel]]
kind: reference
summary: Viewer: play / pause the media, or the animation of a GIF

Plays or pauses the audio or video the [[viewer panel]] previews. In front of a poster no player exists yet: this is what builds it and starts it ([[Media preview]]). In front of a GIF it starts or stops the animation, like `viewer:toggle-gif-animation` — the space key does both.
